{"repositoryId":1219056921,"availability":"available","full":"apohor/rivolt","name":"rivolt","description":"Rivian Companion","category":"Other","language":"Go","stars":10,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-23T13:39:29Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:33:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://preview.rivolt.dev/demo","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:55.953Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:55.953Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:55.953Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:00:55.953Z","stars":10,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real Rivian companion. Live telemetry, per-trip analytics, a real charging cost ledger, and a route planner that tells you what a road trip will actually cost.","Rivolt is an open-source companion app for Rivian vehicles. It streams live telemetry from your truck, records every drive and charging session against your real electricity rate, and plans road trips with cost / weather / efficiency analysis built in.","Rivolt turns your Rivian's charging and driving into a priced ledger you own, and a planner that accounts for what a trip will cost."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/apohor/rivolt/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c0e47be271dfe68e01a6b2b7c0bb36e2a8226f8b8b24337ab1c24de955dfdc9b","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:56.095Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:56.095Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A real Rivian companion. Live telemetry, per-trip analytics, a real charging cost ledger, and a route planner that tells you what a road trip will actually cost.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/apohor/rivolt/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"preview.rivolt.dev/demo is a read-only demo on a generated sample truck: no sign-in, no Rivian account, and no real vehicle data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/apohor/rivolt/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Around those numbers, when an AI provider is wired by the operator, the model writes short categorised commentary across Cost, Efficiency (drive mode, departure timing), Weather (only when there's something material — cold-snap, headwind > 15 kph, precipitation), and Vehicle (tire pressures, pack size, adapter dependency at any stop).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/apohor/rivolt/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"c0e47be271dfe68e01a6b2b7c0bb36e2a8226f8b8b24337ab1c24de955dfdc9b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/apohor/rivolt/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:56.095Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T14:33:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/apohor/rivolt/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T15:00:56.096Z","hash":"c0e47be271dfe68e01a6b2b7c0bb36e2a8226f8b8b24337ab1c24de955dfdc9b","originalBytes":9554,"storedBytes":9554,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["rivian","docs","trip","drive","every","charging","rivolt","when","home","actually","cost","what","route","screenshots","data","energy","kwh","live","page","planner","real","see","signup.md","analysis","dcfc","rate","session","soc","truck","vehicle","account","against","detail","feed","only","own","provider","telemetry","admin","charge","charger","charges","cost.","demo","departure","destination","drives","each","in.","now","one","operator","optional","pack","peak","push","sessions","speed","stop","time.","user","weather","about","access","actual","along","anthropic","any","app","architecture.md","arrival","authorized","average","back","below","beta","binary","built","card","care","chargers","charts","chosen","click","configured","connecting","context","date","dedicated","delivered","distance","doesn","dollar","driver","driving","duration","efficiency","electrafi","feature","final","full","gemini","generated","google","gps","headwind","install-wide","json","land","ledger",